  "title": "Matrix Spiral Order",
  "summary": "Return rectangular-matrix values in clockwise spiral order.",
  "statement": "Return all values of a rectangular matrix in clockwise spiral order, starting at the top-left cell and initially moving right. Visit each cell exactly once. The number of rows need not equal the number of columns, but all rows must have the same length. An empty matrix returns an empty list. Implement `matrix_spiral_order` without changing the signature.",
